<style>
.hover-grid { display:flex; gap:1.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:1rem; }
.figure { text-align:center; position:relative; }
.figure img { width:120px; height:120px; border-radius:50%; border:3px solid #e2e8f0; display:block; }
.figcaption { display:none; margin-top:0.5rem; }
.figure:hover img { border-color:#2563EB; }
.figure:hover .figcaption { display:block; }
.figcaption h5 { margin:0.3rem 0; font-size:0.9rem; color:#1e293b; }
.figcaption a { font-size:0.85rem; color:#2563EB; }
</style>
<div class="practice-page">
  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to exercises</a>
  <h1 class="practice-title">Hovers</h1>
  <div class="practice-banner">    <ul><li>Use <code>Actions.moveToElement()</code> to hover over each user avatar</li>
      <li>Verify the hidden caption (name + View profile link) appears on hover</li>
      <li>Assert the username text matches the expected value (user1, user2, user3)</li>
      <li>Click the "View profile" link that appears on hover</li></ul>
  </div>
  <div class="example">
    <p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.9rem;">Hover over each avatar to reveal hidden information.</p>
    <div class="hover-grid">
      <% 3.times do |count| %>
      <div class="figure">
        <img src="/img/avatar-blank.jpg" alt="User Avatar">
        <div class="figcaption">
          <h5>name: user<%= count+1 %></h5>
          <a href="/users/<%= count+1 %>">View profile</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
